sequenceDiagram
  actor Operator as Nhân viên
  participant UI as Client
  participant API as Backend
  participant SIM as Simulator
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Operator->>UI: Tạo đơn và mission
  UI->>API: POST /missions
  API->>DB: Lưu mission READY
  API-->>UI: Mission ready
  Operator->>UI: Start
  UI->>API: POST /missions/:id/start
  API->>SIM: Start command
  SIM-->>API: Accepted
  API-->>UI: ACK
  loop Each telemetry interval
    SIM-->>UI: Socket.IO telemetry
  end
  Operator->>UI: Xác nhận giao
  UI->>API: Confirm delivery
  API->>DB: Lưu trạng thái order
  SIM->>SIM: Return home
